     9	# / `scripts/refresh-skill-digests.mjs --write` (gh-1106 slice 1, #1109).
    10	# A stale pin silently DROPS that seat and keeps the fleet — repin in the same
    11	# commit as any .agents/skills/<name>/SKILL.md edit.
    12	#
    13	# Model per seat resolves at boot from policy.yaml's `models.seats` tier
    14	# through the priority-ordered concrete candidates below. Keep seat policy in
    15	# policy.yaml; update provider/model availability here. Per-session and
    16	# per-automation model choice happens at dispatch (#1143), never here.
    17	#
    18	# Roster: THREE seats, owner-ratified 2026-08-10 (gh-1187 S0). A seat is
    19	# justified by capability posture, never by model choice. Deferred,
    20	# grow-on-demand seats (`concierge`, `reviewer`, `auditor`, `beadle`, any
    21	# `worker-*` variant) hold no seat and no live persona package; their persona
    22	# material is preserved as test fixtures under packages/agent
    23	# .../agentDefinition/__tests__/fixtures/deferred-personas/. Adding one back =
    24	# restore the package under .agents/personas/ plus an entry in this list.
